f Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and October to November came in under 90% of normal in 39 of 75 years, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 21% of normal in both September to October and October to November. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 23% of normal and May to June at 116%. Grid 12787 had its driest year in 1954 at 58% of normal.</p>"}
